%% DIAGRAM 10: UML SEQUENCE DIAGRAM
%% ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Meteorologist
    participant UI as Dashboard Interface (Web)
    participant Ctrl as Integration Pipeline Controller
    participant Engine as Machine Learning Engine
    participant Sat as Satellite Processing Engine
    participant DB as File System / Data Store

    User ->> UI: Select Date/Time Timestamp
    UI ->> Ctrl: GET /api/observation?timestamp=T
    Ctrl ->> DB: Query Satellite NPZ & Weather Vector
    DB -->> Ctrl: Return Satellite Matrix & 25 Weather Features
    Ctrl ->> Sat: Compute Cloud Mask & Motion Tracking
    Sat -->> Ctrl: Return Centroids, Trajectories, Speeds
